## Publish checklist (all must be true before merging a guide)

- [ ] Every number and date has a source I opened myself, and facts.md is updated
- [ ] No health claims anywhere (check title, description and body)
- [ ] Every `TODO(...)` is resolved with real first-hand detail
- [ ] `draft: true` removed and `date:` set (a future date schedules it)
- [ ] Affiliate links use `aff:key` and the key exists in affiliates.json
- [ ] I read it aloud once and it sounds like us
